{"meta":{"title":"QinYin-xcy的博客","subtitle":"","description":"这是一个个人博客","author":"QianYin-xcy","url":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top","root":"/"},"pages":[{"title":"所有分类","date":"2026-09-03T10:55:58.076Z","updated":"2026-09-03T10:55:58.076Z","comments":true,"path":"categories/index.html","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/categories/index.html","excerpt":"","text":""},{"title":"所有标签","date":"2026-09-03T10:56:38.761Z","updated":"2026-09-03T10:56:38.761Z","comments":true,"path":"tags/index.html","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/index.html","excerpt":"","text":""},{"title":"","date":"2026-09-03T10:55:19.989Z","updated":"2026-09-03T10:55:19.989Z","comments":true,"path":"about/index.html","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/about/index.html","excerpt":"","text":"下面写关于自己的内容"},{"title":"我的朋友们","date":"2026-09-03T10:57:28.903Z","updated":"2026-09-03T10:57:28.903Z","comments":true,"path":"friends/index.html","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/friends/index.html","excerpt":"这里写友链上方的内容。","text":"这里写友链上方的内容。 这里可以写友链页面下方的文字备注，例如自己的友链规范、示例等。"}],"posts":[{"title":"CAN协议","slug":"CAN","date":"2026-09-03T00:58:49.465Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:41:37.108Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/03/CAN/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/03/CAN/","excerpt":"","text":"","categories":[],"tags":[],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"FreeRTOS操作系统","slug":"FreeRTOS","date":"2026-09-03T00:57:51.946Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:42:02.871Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/03/FreeRTOS/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/03/FreeRTOS/","excerpt":"","text":"","categories":[],"tags":[],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"单总线协议","slug":"Single_wire","date":"2026-09-03T00:55:58.395Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:42:26.500Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/03/Single_wire/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/03/Single_wire/","excerpt":"","text":"","categories":[],"tags":[],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"SPI协议","slug":"SPI","date":"2026-09-03T00:55:38.676Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:42:40.160Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/03/SPI/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/03/SPI/","excerpt":"","text":"","categories":[],"tags":[],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"IIC协议","slug":"IIC","date":"2026-09-03T00:54:38.208Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:42:13.072Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/03/IIC/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/03/IIC/","excerpt":"","text":"","categories":[],"tags":[],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"C语言错题","slug":"C_launguage_wrong answer","date":"2026-09-03T00:49:47.616Z","updated":"2026-09-03T23:48:45.355Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/03/C_launguage_wrong answer/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/03/C_launguage_wrong%20answer/","excerpt":"","text":"记录学习过程中易错、易混淆的 C 语言知识点，持续更新…… 📌 第 1 题：^和&lt;&lt;的优先级设有以下语句： 12char a = 3, b = 6, c;c = a ^ b &lt;&lt; 2; 则 c 的二进制值是 ______。 ❌ 我的错误答案：0100（即十进制 4）,错误原因：混淆了 ^ 和 &lt;&lt; 的优先级，误以为按位异或先于左移，于是先计算 a ^ b，再左移 2 位。 ✅ 正确解析：在 C 语言中，左移运算符 &lt;&lt; 的优先级高于按位异或 ^，所以原式等价于 a ^ (b &lt;&lt; 2)。计算过程：6 &lt;&lt; 2 &#x3D; 24（二进制 11000） 3 ^ 24 &#x3D; 27（二进制 11011） 正确答案：11011（十进制 27） 📌 第 2 题：结构体指针与成员访问根据以下定义，错误 的表达式是： 12struct &#123;int a; char b;&#125; Q, *p = &amp;Q;A. Q.a B. (*p).b C. p-&gt;a D. *p.b ❌我的错误倾向容易混淆 *p.b 与 (*p).b，忽略了成员运算符 . 的优先级高于解引用 *。 ✅ 正确解析：成员访问运算符 . 的优先级 高于 解引用运算符 *，因此 *p.b 会被解析为 *(p.b)。但 p 是指针，不能直接用 . 访问成员，必须写作 (*p).b 或 p-&gt;b。 正确答案：D. *p.b 📌 第 3 题：结构体首地址与强制类型转换分析以下代码的运算结果： 123456struct node &#123; int a; int b; int c;&#125;;struct node s = &#123;3, 5, 6&#125;;struct node *pt = &amp;s;printf(&quot;%d\\n&quot;, *(int *)pt); ❌ 我的错误答案：6 错误原因：误以为指针 pt 指向结构体的末尾（成员 c），实际上指针存储的是结构体的 首地址。 ✅ 正确解析：结构体在内存中连续分布，其首地址即第一个成员 a 的地址。(int *)pt 将结构体指针强转为整型指针，解引用后读取从首地址开始的 int 大小数据，正好是成员 a 的值。 正确答案：3 📌 第 4 题：冒泡排序实现用 C 语言对数组 a[10] &#x3D; {6, 2, 8, 11, 0, 7, 3, -3, 9, 12} 进行 升序排列。 ❌ 我的错误状态：对排序算法的双重循环逻辑不熟练，不知道如何通过嵌套循环实现元素比较与交换。 ✅ 正确解析（冒泡排序）：核心思想：两两比较相邻元素，如果反序则交换，每轮将当前最大值“冒泡”到数组末端。 完整代码： 123456789101112131415161718192021222324#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;int main() &#123; int a[10] = &#123;6, 2, 8, 11, 0, 7, 3, -3, 9, 12&#125;; int i, j, temp; // 外层循环：控制轮数（10个数需 9 轮） for (i = 0; i &lt; 9; i++) &#123; // 内层循环：每轮两两比较，最大值沉底 for (j = 0; j &lt; 9 - i; j++) &#123; if (a[j] &gt; a[j + 1]) &#123; temp = a[j]; a[j] = a[j + 1]; a[j + 1] = temp; &#125; &#125; &#125; // 打印排序结果 for (i = 0; i &lt; 10; i++) &#123; printf(&quot;%d &quot;, a[i]); &#125; return 0;&#125; 运行结果：-3 0 2 3 6 7 8 9 11 12","categories":[{"name":"笔记","slug":"笔记","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/categories/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/"}],"tags":[{"name":"C语言错题","slug":"C语言错题","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/C%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E9%94%99%E9%A2%98/"}],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"linux常见命令","slug":"Common_Linux_commands","date":"2026-09-02T02:53:53.388Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:41:49.699Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/02/Common_Linux_commands/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/02/Common_Linux_commands/","excerpt":"","text":"在Linux终端下工作，掌握常用命令是基本技能。","categories":[{"name":"笔记","slug":"笔记","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/categories/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/"}],"tags":[{"name":"Linux","slug":"Linux","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/Linux/"},{"name":"命令","slug":"命令","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/"}],"author":"QianYin-xcy"},{"title":"github搭建博客（volantis主题）","slug":"GitHub_Blog_Setup","date":"2026-09-01T10:26:36.263Z","updated":"2026-09-03T08:40:33.826Z","comments":true,"path":"2026/09/01/GitHub_Blog_Setup/","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/2026/09/01/GitHub_Blog_Setup/","excerpt":"","text":"这篇文章记录了从零搭建个人博客的完整教程，包括环境配置、主题安装、个性化设置和部署上线。","categories":[{"name":"博客搭建","slug":"博客搭建","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/categories/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/"}],"tags":[{"name":"GitHub Pages","slug":"GitHub-Pages","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top/tags/GitHub-Pages/"},{"name":"Hexo","slug":"Hexo","permalink":"https://www.qianyin-xcy.top